### Phase 1 API Request Collection
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Public Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 2. Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me

### 3. User Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/settings

### 4. Update User Settings
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Alex Chen",
  "theme": "dark",
  "timezone": "America/New_York",
  "notifyDeadlines": true,
  "notifyMentions": true
}

### 5. Add User API Key (Encrypted AES-256-GCM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/api-keys
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "OPENAI",
  "label": "My OpenAI Key",
  "key": "sk-proj-1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef"
}

### 6. Delete User API Key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/api-keys/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 7. Request Data Export
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/export

### 8. Download Data Export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/export/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 9. Delete User Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": "DELETE"
}

### 10. List Event Templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/event-templates

### 11. Suggest Room Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/suggest-name

### 12. Create Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Neural Nexus Hackers",
  "description": "Building edge AI copilot",
  "projectDescription": "Local LLM runner with vector store",
  "templateId": "sih-2025",
  "timezone": "UTC"
}

### 13. List My Active Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms

### 14. Get Room Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 15. Update Room Details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Neural Nexus V2",
  "description": "Updated project description"
}

### 16. Regenerate Room Join Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/regenerate-join-code

### 17. Archive Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/archive

### 18. Home Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home

### 19. Room Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/overview

### 20. List Room Members & Invitations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/members

### 21. Update Member Role (or Transfer Leadership)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/members/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "DESIGNER"
}

### 22. Update Member Skills
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/members/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skills": ["React", "TypeScript", "TailwindCSS"]
}

### 23. Remove Member (Leader only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/members/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 24. Leave Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/leave

### 25. Create Invite Link
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/invites
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "MEMBER",
  "maxUses": 5
}

### 26. List Active Invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/invites

### 27. Revoke Invite Link
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/invites/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### 28. Preview Public Invite (Unauthenticated or Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/INVITE_TOKEN_HERE

### 29. Join by Public Invite Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/INVITE_TOKEN_HERE/join

### 30. Join by 4-Character Join Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ABCD"
}

### 31. List User Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?limit=20

### 32. Get Unread Notification Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/unread-count

### 33. List Room Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/notifications

### 34. Mark Single Room Notification Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/notifications/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/read

### 35. Mark All Notifications Read for Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/notifications/mark-all-read

### 36. Mark All Notifications Read Across App
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/mark-all-read

### 37. Seed Dev Fake Members (Dev profile only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/fake-members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 4
}
